<h1>8 queens</h1>
<p>
(classic problem)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
Place eight chess queens on an 8 &times; 8 board such that no queen can attack another.  Efficiently find all possible placements.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Generalization</strong> (I am a kind of ...)<br>
<a href="nqueens.html"><em>n queens</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

Go to the
<a href="https://www.nist.gov/dads/">Dictionary of Algorithms and Data
Structures</a> home page.

